    "created_at": "2015-11-06T17:36:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-06T17:36:25Z",
    "body": "Okay, so one problem would be that you navigate to a cross-origin URL, that redirects to a javascript URL, and that ends up executing in the current browsing context. That does indeed seem bad.\n\nDo you happen to have tested what browsers do today?\n",
