    "created_at": "2015-11-06T18:05:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-11-06T18:05:00Z",
    "body": "Firefox and IE treat it as a network error. (IE gives \"This page can’t be displayed...\", Firefox gives \"Corrupted Content Error\".)  Chrome aborts the navigation like a 204 response, regardless of the origin.\n",
